OL,3,AAt least five dead after Amazon cargo
OL,4,Aplane speeds off runway at Miami
OL,5,Aairport
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe incident happened at about 14:00
OL,8,Flocal time (19:00 BST), according to
OL,9,Fthe Federal Aviation Administration
OL,11,FVideos and images from the area show
OL,12,Fthick black smoke rising over the
OL,13,Faircraft that crashed after its flight
OL,14,Ffrom San Juan, Puerto Rico
